# Section 4, the NEW tutorial: the Cassegrain telescope, typed from the prompts (Example Light Source)
# and finished element by element (Example Telescope) -- Dave 2026-10-19: regenerate the NEW tutorials as
# plain dialogs (TRANSCRIPT_DIFF.md #11).  The answers are 3.2's; the current dialog adds the base-units and
# glass-type prompts, both answered with their defaults.  The deck NEW writes traces as examples/Cassegrain.in
# does: same rays to the focal plane and the same mean path at the same grid, the OPD at the round-off floor.
